Z||000005||Songman||08-22-2001||09:27 AM||||That kit is for sale online somewhere but I can't find the link right now.<P>So far they only have one kit for sale and it is the prototype. The full kit is not actually in production yet. Not bad prices either. Seems like the full car can be had for around $18k... but you can't put a top on it.. Not good in the Eastern US!<P>The link has been posted on the forum before. Do a search and you'll find the link and you can see more pics of the car and pics of all the parts required to do it.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
