Z||000007||MinnGreenGT||08-22-2001||09:58 AM||||The kit was designed and built by <A HREF="http://www.exoticrebodies.com" TARGET=_blank>exotic rebodies</A> and yes, the one shown in the picture is the original/prototype.  I'm not sure of the current kit price, but they were talking around $12,500 for the full kit-<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
