Z||000009||dman||08-22-2001||05:51 PM||||Hello everyone.<P>MinnGreenGT, that kit was -not- designed by exoticrebodies.com. That company just happens to be a distributor and has absolutely nothing to do with the design of any of the kits it sells.<P>Do a search on this forum, you'll find several threads discussing that car. I've seen it firsthand. It does look awesome. Definitely a unique car. Ah heck, the Porsche Carrera GT that it resembles isn't even available yet.<P><BR>||||reg||1
