Z||000011||MinnGreenGT||08-22-2001||05:59 PM||||sorry dman... I used to recieve regular updates from exoticrebodies.com showing the progress of the creation (illustrations) to the buck, to the molds, and eventually the final piece including shots of it's first carshow run.  I had just assumed that they were directly related to the work being done-due to the large amount of info they provided me on a regular basis.  If they aren't the producers (which is certainly possible and even likely) then who is?<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
