Z||000013||dman||08-22-2001||11:19 PM||||Hello again.<P>MinnGreenGT, the person responsible for creating that kit (among others) was at the Knotts car show. I was very impressed with his work. I guess he made those pics available to that distributor.<P>I suspect that he would prefer to remain on the quiet side of things (design and make cool cars) rather than trying to sell them. I can't go into details but I believe he has been forced to disassociate himself completely from his earlier designs because a distributor of his kits was busted by a European auto maker (you figure it out) and the distributor snitched on him. Very uncool.<P> <BR>||||reg||1
